# box_crater_edge_repro.scene
# Normal-terrain repro for boxes sleeping while balanced on an edge.
#
# The stock terrain is a crater/bowl. These cubes start just inside the high
# rim, with seeded random angle/radius/rotation jitter, then roll inward under
# gravity with water hidden.
#
# Seed: 1 from the temporary crater random-search harness.

physics on
text off
frames 1500
exit_on_complete
fixed_step
time_scale 6.0
world -50.0 0.0 998.0
water_hidden on

camera overview 620 310 1040  620 55 620  0 1 0


